# Engli stdlib: numbers — numeric helpers.
Export Define function absolute taking n as number giving number:
    Return abs(n).
End.
Export Define function rounded taking n as number, places as whole giving number:
    Return round(n, places).
End.
Export Define function integer taking n giving whole:
    Return int(n).
End.
Export Define function decimal taking s giving number:
    Return float(s).
End.
Export Define function clamp taking n as number, lo as number, hi as number giving number:
    Return max(lo, min(n, hi)).
End.
